>:\u00a0play through the adventure with a friend via drop-in/drop-out co-op multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974160/extras/fcca6492ebbb14a7f76eee30fff8bc71.poster.avif?t=1753373265\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974160/extras/fcca6492ebbb14a7f76eee30fff8bc71.webm?t=1753373265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974160/extras/fcca6492ebbb14a7f76eee30fff8bc71.mp4?t=1753373265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haunting original score</strong>:\u00a0Blighted features new music by Jim Guthrie, the acclaimed composer of\u00a0<i>Superbrothers: Sword &amp; Sworcery EP, Below,</i> and<i>\u00a0Nobody Saves the World</i>.</p></li></ul>",
